Trimmed from PCO (Ptolemaic Coins Online), American Numismatic Society,
https://numismatics.org/pco/nomisma.rdf retrieved 2026-09-24. Type data under the Open
Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Six type records and their sides, verbatim, with the root namespace declarations the
export makes on its rdf:RDF element. Three are Lorber CPE types (part 1, a lettered
part 1 number, and a part 2 bronze); three are Svoronos numbers, two of them replaced by
the CPE types beside them and one not replaced at all.
-->
