        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Coin type "Svoronos 487" as defined in the publication Svoronos, Joannes N. Ta nomismata tou kratous ton Ptolemaion. Athens, 1904-1908.</skos:definition>
        <skos:note xml:lang="en">Derived label is "Ptolemy II Philadelphos, 285-246 B.C.", though this may not reflect latest opinion on this type.</skos:note>
